    "@value" : "AGETXT"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Used when the age is a range and the exact birthdate is not known. This variable is a character field for the purposes of defining age ranges, e.g., if the information available for the age of the subject is 6-8 and AGEU is WEEKS. Populate only when BRTHDTC or AGE is not specified. The format for AGETXT is \"number-number\" (e.g., 6-8)."
  } ],
